  serviceId, estados, FDN svc-mgr:service-<id>:<siteId>.
  NO trae SAP ni BGP.

Body:
{
  "find": {
    "fullClassName": "vprn.Site",
    "filter": {
      "wildcard": {
        "name": "objectFullName",
        "value": "svc-mgr:service-1:%"
      }
    },
    "resultFilter": {
      "children": "",
      "attribute": [
        "objectFullName",
        "siteId",
        "serviceId",
        "displayedName",
        "administrativeState",
        "operationalState"
      ]
    }
  }
}


================================================================
5) Site VPRN en un NE concreto
================================================================
Que trae:
  Un solo vprn.Site. Confirma que el servicio esta desplegado
  en ese equipo y si esta up.

