================================================================
10) CPAA (analizador CPAM)
================================================================
Que trae:
  Equipo 7701: IP, routerId, rol (igp/bgp), AS IGP, AS BGP,
  protocolEventTypes, protocolRecord, timestamps de retrieve.
  NO filtrar isCheckpointObject (esa property no existe aca).

Body:
{
  "find": {
    "fullClassName": "topology.Cpaa"
  }
}

Resultado real:
  FDN network:10.251.243.250:cpaa
  IP 172.24.80.31   routerId 10.251.243.250
  rol igp+bgp   estado up/up
  asPointer        tpgy-mgr:name-UTE-AS-0
  bgpAsPointer     tpgy-mgr:AS-65000
  protocolEventTypes  ospf, bgp
  protocolRecord      ospf, ospfTe     <-- NO incluye bgp
  bgpRibInfoLastRetrieveTime = 0
  bgpVpnv4RoutTargetLastRetrieveTime = 0
  Lectura: el CPAA tiene rol BGP pero protocolRecord no graba RIB.
           Aun asi hay objetos RT/NH (queries 14-16).


